21_horse_model.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/contents/chicago%2F4d%2Fdata%2Fsources%2Fsevketkabatas_2021_horse_model.json?ref=fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@\n+{\n+  \"id\": \"sevketkabatas_2021_horse_model\",\n+  \"type\": \"website\",\n+  \"citation\": \"sevketkabatas, “Horse”, published 29 March 2021, CC BY 4.0, retrieved via AllenAI Objaverse by ordinary public HTTP200 on 22 October 2026.\",\n+  \"author\": \"sevketkabatas\",\n+  \"date\": \"2021-03-29\",\n+  \"describes_date\": \"2021-03-29\",\n+  \"repository\": \"Sketchfab / AllenAI Objaverse individual model\",\n+  \"url\": \"https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/horse-53a6eb7ccf054aa2a378dd7ec08f88fe\",\n+  \"archived_url\": \"https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/objaverse/resolve/main/glbs/000-124/53a6eb7ccf054aa2a378dd7ec08f88fe.glb\",\n+  \"tier\": 5,\n+  \"rights_status\": \"cleared\",\n+  \"rights_note\": \"Current public author API, archived individual Objaverse metadata and actual embedded GLB asset.extras all identify CC BY4.0. Original source/texture bytes retained; dataset-wide ODC-By1.0 notice and individual credit retained separately.\",\n+  \"rights_checked\": {\n+    \"date\": \"2026-10-22\",\n+    \"method\": \"Three agreeing individual rights records plus normal unauthenticated public acquisition; actual source mesh, textures, rig/default pose and four native views inspected.\",\n+    \"outcome\": \"Cleared source redistribution/adaptation with author/source/license credit and change notice under CC BY4.0.\"\n+  },\n+  \"asset_use\": \"cross_check\",\n+  \"verified\": true,\n+  \"note\": \"Modern development-base geometry/coat/rights only, not historical evidence. All1835 individual, phenotype, size, grooming and placement choices remain reconstructed. The current canonical26 derivative b479442c uses project-reconstructed rig/V16 skin and planted body-shift clip; original source remains unchanged in preserved acquisition/recovery records. No source motion is relabelled walk or composed with this clip. Photographic, tack, riding and hitching remain open.\",\n+  \"what_it_supplies\": [\n+    \"Redistributable textured modern source mesh/maps under CC BY4.0, used in an explicitly reconstructed canonical26 planted-standing derivative.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"what_it_does_not_supply\": [\n+    \"Historical Chicago animal identity/breed/coat/ownership/date, verified metric size, approved locomotion, fitted harness or photographic-master acceptance.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"access_notes\": \"Ordinary public Objaverse redistribution returned HTTP200 without authentication on2026-10-22. Model publication2021-03-29 and acquisition2026-10-22 describe the MODERN asset, not the target1835scene. Current individual API, archived object metadata and embedded GLB asset.extras agree on CC BY4.0.\"\n+}"},{"sha":"b030276e81a3b1e3adc18442777013b8dac43053","filename":"chicago/4d/data/transport/parked/horse-sevket-sidecar.json","status":"added","additions":5292,"deletions":0,"changes":5292,"blob_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/blob/fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8/chicago%2F4d%2Fdata%2Ftransport%2Fparked%2Fhorse-sevket-sidecar.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/raw/fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8/chicago%2F4d%2Fdata%2Ftransport%2Fparked%2Fhorse-sevket-sidecar.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/contents/chicago%2F4d%2Fdata%2Ftransport%2Fparked%2Fhorse-sevket-sidecar.json?ref=fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8"},{"sha":"2913dc3dda3947356f2722e8a5a0d3de2f5468a8","filename":"chicago/4d/data/transport/parked/standing-horse-planted/export-receipt.json","status":"added","additions":106,"deletions":0,"changes":106,"blob_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/blob/fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8/chicago%2F4d%2Fdata%2Ftransport%2Fparked%2Fstanding-horse-planted%2Fexport-receipt.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chica